<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>Find the \(x\)-intercepts and the \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex for the equation \(y=x^2+6x\).</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
    <item> What are the \(x\)-intercepts for the equation \(y=x^2+6x\)? </item>
  </list>
  
  <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
  <para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((0,0)\),\((-6,0)\)</para>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
    <item> What is the \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex for the equation \(y=x^2+6x\)? </item>
  </list>
  
  <para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> -3</para>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>Find the \(x\)-intercepts and the \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex for the equation \(y=x^2-10x\).</item>
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
    <item> What are the \(x\)-intercepts for the equation \(y=x^2-10x\)? </item>
  </list>
  
  <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
  <para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((0,0)\),\((10,0)\)</para>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
    <item> What is the \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex for the equation \(y=x^2-10x\)? </item>
